From 95f8440b7bddde3e46fc595474cc74ed6b34cef6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Fontana <alessandro.fontana@pm.me>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:04:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Add MPEG-4 Part 2 and H.263 encoders

Add c2.v4l2.mpeg4.encoder and c2.v4l2.h263.encoder for stateful V4L2
devices, enabled with ro.vendor.v4l2_codec2.encoder.supported.{mpeg4,h263}:

- MPEG-4 Simple, levels 0 to 5, max QP 31. The headers in front of the
  first VOP (VOS, VO, VOL) are output as codec config data.
- H.263 Baseline, max QP 31.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Ia0730bb953bc23fe295e6bffd1b93ee96aa1c246
